# Worldbuilding Canon

- **The Archives ARE the entire facility/building.** "The Archives" is the name of
  the whole site — it is NOT a single room, wing, block, or department within a
  larger building. Never describe the Archives as a specific section of the facility.
  When writing story text, dialogue, or descriptions, treat "the Archives" and
  "the facility/building" as the same place.
